   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening food control and food safety laboratory capacity in Burkina Faso, Niger, and Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) strengthening capacity of SMEs in understanding and complying with regulatory food controls including SPS Measures, Codex food standards, GHPs/GMPs and HACCP, 
(ii) Strengthening Food Control Systems Along the Value Chains of Priority (most traded) food commodities.
(iii) strengthening ability to develop and implement of food control standards and certification. The FAO/WHO food control system assessment tool will be used to guide the approach and the methodology for the assessment of the food control systems</narrative>
  </description>
